   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">PRJ302 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.4</span>\n<h2>Textbooks, materials & tools the university names</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Main textbooks: <strong><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/html/home/welcome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/html/home/welcome</a></strong>; <strong><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/introcss/home/welcome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/introcss/home/welcome</a></strong>; <strong><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/javascript/home/welcome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/javascript/home/welcome</a></strong>; <strong><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/responsivedesign/home/welcome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/responsivedesign/home/welcome</a></strong>; <strong>Professional Java® for Web Applications</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 12684 · Decision 359/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 09/04/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">PRJ302 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.4</span>\n<h2>Giáo trình, tài liệu & công cụ trường quy định</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Giáo trình chính: <strong><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/html/home/welcome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/html/home/welcome</a></strong>; <strong><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/introcss/home/welcome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/introcss/home/welcome</a></strong>; <strong><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/javascript/home/welcome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/javascript/home/welcome</a></strong>; <strong><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/responsivedesign/home/welcome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/responsivedesign/home/welcome</a></strong>; <strong>Professional Java® for Web Applications</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 12684 · QĐ 359/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 09/04/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Material<br><small>Tài liệu</small></th><th>Author<br><small>Tác giả</small></th><th>Publisher<br><small>NXB</small></th><th>Year<br><small>Năm</small></th><th>Edition<br><small>Lần xuất bản</small></th><th>ISBN</th><th>Main<br><small>Chính</small></th><th>Hard copy<br><small>Bản in</small></th><th>Online</th><th>Note<br><small>Ghi chú</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/html/home/welcome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/html/home/welcome</a></strong></td><td></td><td>Coursera</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>MOOC 1: Introduction to HTML5</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/introcss/home/welcome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/introcss/home/welcome</a></strong></td><td></td><td>Coursera</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>MOOC 2: Introduction to CSS3</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/javascript/home/welcome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/javascript/home/welcome</a></strong></td><td></td><td>Coursera</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>MOOC 3: Interactivity with JavaScript</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/responsivedesign/home/welcome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/responsivedesign/home/welcome</a></strong></td><td></td><td>Coursera</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>MOOC 4: Advanced Styling with Responsive Design</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>Professional Java® for Web Applications</strong></td><td>Nicholas S. Williams</td><td>Wrox</td><td></td><td>1st edition</td><td><code>978-1118656464</code></td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td><a href=\"http://library.books24x7.com/toc.aspx?bookid=62587\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://library.books24x7.com/toc.aspx?bookid=62587</a></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>Article 1: <a href=\"http://docs.oracle.com/javase/tutorial/JDBC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://docs.oracle.com/javase/tutorial/JDBC</a></strong></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>Article 2: <a href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/cd/B14099_19/web.1012/b14017/filters.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://docs.oracle.com/cd/B14099_19/web.1012/b14017/filters.htm</a></strong></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>8</td><td><strong>Session 3 Guide to Using Prompt Engineering Effectively with Java Web</strong></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>9</td><td><strong>Session 8 AI_Netbeans24</strong></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>10</td><td><strong>Session 15 Using a Database Query Agent in Java Web Applications</strong></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Tools</h3>\n<p>Web server application :Tomcat 10 or higher<br>IDE: Netbeans 13 or higher (as defined by the subject leader)<br>Java EE: 1.8 or higher<br>MS SQL Server 2019 or higher</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Materials with no author/ISBN (slides, exercise packs…) are usually internal files you download inside FLM with your FPT account. Buy the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed — page and exercise numbers change between editions.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Công cụ</h3>\n<p>Web server application :Tomcat 10 or higher<br>IDE: Netbeans 13 or higher (as defined by the subject leader)<br>Java EE: 1.8 or higher<br>MS SQL Server 2019 or higher</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN (slide, bộ bài tập…) thường là file nội bộ, tải trong FLM bằng tài khoản FPT. Mua đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng — số trang, số bài tập đổi giữa các bản.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12684\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12684</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12684\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12684</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
